{"nodes": [{"id": "extracted_projects_the_method_board_3_revised_stale_build_finding", "label": "The Shipped Book Layer Is a Stale Build", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "extracted/projects/the-method/BOARD-3-REVISED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A status read from a generated artefact is a statement about the build date; every OPEN in the book layer must be checked against REGISTER-DATA.md."}, {"id": "extracted_projects_the_method_board_3_revised_ask_register_not_build", "label": "Ask the Register, Not the Build", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "extracted/projects/the-method/BOARD-3-REVISED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Earned by three faults in one session, each a status read off a stale generated artefact and handed to M as a question."}, {"id": "extracted_projects_the_method_board_3_revised_lambda_ladder", "label": "Lambda_ladder", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "extracted/projects/the-method/BOARD-3-REVISED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Closed at R 1427: fourteen ladders, nine cells, E = 0, once the X-ray pair is seated at subvalence; the PDF prints it OPEN on pre-R-1427 coordinates."}, {"id": "extracted_projects_the_method_board_3_revised_m_c2_condition", "label": "M.C2 and the ANE-Vacuum Cyclicity Condition", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "extracted/projects/the-method/BOARD-3-REVISED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The fourth condition actually assumed is cyclicity of the ANE-vacuum for the horizon-cut algebra, not supplied by Reeh-Schlieder and absent from M.C2's own check."}, {"id": "extracted_projects_the_method_board_3_revised_referee_flag_5", "label": "Referee Flag 5 - the Kurucz/Tripwire Run", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "extracted/projects/the-method/BOARD-3-REVISED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Re-graded at R 251-252 to targets-identified; M ruled 'run it please' and the run's outcome is not visible in the transcripts."}, {"id": "extracted_projects_the_method_board_3_revised_referee_flag_4", "label": "Referee Flag 4 - the Withdrawal Ratio", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "extracted/projects/the-method/BOARD-3-REVISED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Withdrawn as a proposal: the press already computes the ratio at every build, and it has moved 0.445 to 0.249."}, {"id": "extracted_projects_the_method_board_3_revised_register_behind_work", "label": "The Register Is Behind the Work", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "extracted/projects/the-method/BOARD-3-REVISED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "R 1701 and R 1702 are earned and unwritten, so both gates run against a register that does not hold two closed results."}, {"id": "extracted_projects_the_method_board_3_revised_q_open_items", "label": "Q's Ten Open Items", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "extracted/projects/the-method/BOARD-3-REVISED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Stable across builds; a single narrow search returned no closure, which under R 1672 is a statement about the search."}, {"id": "extracted_projects_the_method_board_3_revised_press_blocked_on_bank", "label": "The Press Is Blocked on the Bank", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "extracted/projects/the-method/BOARD-3-REVISED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "c